---
permalink: /en/tour/recorrido/
title: "Route & itinerary"
description: "The Palomino Islands tour route: La Punta, El Camotal, San Lorenzo, El Frontón, Cavinzas and Palomino. History and wildlife at every stop."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/en/tour/">The Tour</a><span>›</span> Route</nav>
    <div class="media-split" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">
      <div class="media-split__media">
        <img src="/assets/img/galeria/g24.jpg" alt="A young couple enjoying the Palomino Islands voyage" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Route</p>
        <h1>Six stops, one unforgettable voyage</h1>
        <p class="lead">Each departure crosses Callao bay — its history and its wildlife — all the way to the Palomino Islands.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="video-wrap" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)">
      <div class="embed">
        <video controls playsinline preload="metadata" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;background:#000">
          <source src="/assets/video/recorrido-islas-palomino.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          Your browser does not support HTML5 video. <a href="/assets/video/recorrido-islas-palomino.mp4">Download the video</a>.
        </video>
      </div>
      <p class="embed-caption"><strong>Our Route</strong> — a look at the full voyage, from our private pier in La Punta to the sea-lion colony of the Palomino Islands. Each stop is detailed below.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid cols-2">
      {%- set stopPhotos = [14,15,16,17,13,19] -%}
      {% for stop in site.route %}
      <article class="card card--top reveal">
        <div class="card__media"><img src="/assets/img/galeria/g{{ stopPhotos[loop.index0] }}.jpg" alt="{{ stop.en }} — Palomino Islands voyage" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="card__body">
        <span class="icon-chip">{{ icon("pin") }}</span>
        <p class="eyebrow">Stop {{ loop.index }}</p>
        <h3>{{ stop.en }}</h3>
        <p>{{ stop.desc_en }}</p>
      </div></article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <h3>Duration &amp; logistics</h3>
      <p>Approximate duration: <strong>3.5 hours</strong>. <strong>Daily departures by reservation</strong> (Mon–Fri 11:30 a. m.; Sat, Sun &amp; holidays 10:00 a. m.).</p>
      <p style="margin-top:var(--space-3)"><strong>Meeting point:</strong> {{ site.embarkation.name }} — {{ site.embarkation.address }}. {{ site.embarkation.directions_en }} <a href="{{ site.embarkation.mapsLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Google Maps →</a></p>
      <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-6);align-items:start">
        <table class="schedule">
          <caption>Boarding times</caption>
          <tbody>
          {% for s in site.schedule %}
            <tr><td>{{ s.en }}{% if s.note_en %}<br><small style="color:var(--text-secondary)">{{ s.note_en }}</small>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ s.time }}</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="embed embed--map">
          <iframe src="{{ site.embarkation.mapsEmbed }}" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Meeting point map — Muelle Club Canottieri, La Punta, Callao"></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
